{"id":"11736fadef5be849","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md","title":"Analytical Hierarchy","display":"df-analytical-hierarchy — Analytical Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-analytical-hierarchy","aliases":["92-df-analytical-hierarchy"],"display":"df-analytical-hierarchy — Analytical Hierarchy","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-analytical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-analytical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analytical-hierarchy — Analytical Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N\\coloneqq\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal N\\coloneqq\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (Baire space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Bor}(\\mathcal N^k)\">\\(\\mathbf{Bor}(\\mathcal N^k)\\)</span> (Borel sigma-algebra on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N^k\">\\(\\mathcal N^k\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_k:\\mathcal N^{k+1}\\to\\mathcal N^k\">\\(\\pi_k:\\mathcal N^{k+1}\\to\\mathcal N^k\\)</span> (projection onto the first <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> coordinates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_n(k))_{n,k\\geq1}\">\\((\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_n(k))_{n,k\\geq1}\\)</span> (definition-target projective pointclasses)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_1(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi_k[B]\\mid B\\in\\mathbf{Bor}(\\mathcal N^{k+1})\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathcal N^k\\setminus A\\mid A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_{n+1}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi_k[B]\\mid B\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k+1)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_n(k)\\coloneqq\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\cap\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_1(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi_k[B]\\mid B\\in\\mathbf{Bor}(\\mathcal N^{k+1})\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathcal N^k\\setminus A\\mid A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_{n+1}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi_k[B]\\mid B\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k+1)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_n(k)\\coloneqq\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\cap\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>解析层级：二阶量词层级</li>\n<li>超出算术层级</li>\n<li>量化集合而非数</li>\n<li>这里采用描述集合论中的粗体投射层级约定</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span>：存在集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>：对所有集合</li>\n<li>与超算术集相关</li>\n<li>粗体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_1(k)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_1(k)\\)</span> 是 Borel 点类；轻体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^1_1\">\\(\\Delta^1_1\\)</span> 才对应超算术集合</li>\n<li>更高层级的复杂性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal N\\coloneqq\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Bor}(\\mathcal N^k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_k:\\mathcal N^{k+1}\\to\\mathcal N^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_n(k))_{n,k\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytical\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash{}&\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_1(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi_k[B]\\mid B\\in\\mathbf{Bor}(\\mathcal N^{k+1})\\},\\\\\n&\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathcal N^k\\setminus A\\mid A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\},\\\\\n&\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_{n+1}(k)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\pi_k[B]\\mid B\\in\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k+1)\\},\\\\\n&\\forall k,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\qquad\n\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_n(k)\\coloneqq\n\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\cap\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Delta^1_1(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":1642,"backlinks":[{"id":"c92cae1596fbaf3e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k))_{n\\geq1}$ (projective pointclasses, see [[92-df-analytical-hierarchy]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[